msgctxt "408"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "429"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "439"
msgid "Order"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "445"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "466"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "498"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "533"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "561"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "581"
msgid "Okay. That comes to %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "605"
msgid ""
"This silver ring is adorned with rose quartz. It's sure to\n"
"please any woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "682"
msgid ""
"The heart-shaped cubic zirconia set in this ring is \n"
"quite charming. It's a popular gift for women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "782"
msgid ""
"The cross on this ring is inlaid with cubic zirconia. It \n"
"makes a great gift with its unique beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "883"
msgid ""
"A ring with a heart made of white cubic zirconia. It's a\n"
"real piece of art. Any woman would be happy to \n"
"receive this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1002"
msgid ""
"This ring is studded with a row of high-quality rubies.\n"
"The perfect gift for that special someone in your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1114"
msgid ""
"Real white diamonds adorn this impressive bracelet.\n"
"It would make a fine gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1193"
msgid ""
"Inlaid with onyx, quartz, and agate. It's a beautiful \n"
"gift item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1259"
msgid ""
"The pink opal in this power stone bracelet is \n"
"supposed to bring out the wearer's inner beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1355"
msgid ""
"This is a power stone bracelet inlaid with Inca rose, \n"
"which is said to bring good luck. Do you have a lady \n"
"in your life who'd like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1494"
msgid ""
"A top-seller due to its colorful design. I'm sure it \n"
"would make some girl very happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1581"
msgid ""
"These ruby earrings are adorned with elegant, \n"
"high-quality rubies. A fine gift for a woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1674"
msgid ""
"Cute, heart-shaped earrings made of rose quartz. \n"
"They should go with any outfit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1756"
msgid ""
"A deep red necklace of garnet. When the light hits it \n"
"just right, it appears to be burning inside. Popular \n"
"among women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1878"
msgid ""
"They say the Inca rose on this birdcage strap can heal \n"
"emotional scars. It would make a nice gift for \n"
"someone in need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1999"
msgid ""
"A chic crown pin made of black cubic zirconia and \n"
"bearing the Black Label emblem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2082"
msgid ""
"A pendant made of black cubic zirconia and bearing \n"
"the Black Label emblem. Adds a little extra \n"
"masculinity to any man wearing it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2214"
msgid ""
"Has real diamonds embedded in the dragon. It's sure\n"
"to make any man wearing it that much more suave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2315"
msgid ""
"A heart-shaped necklace inlaid with power\n"
"stones. Look at that Rhodolite garnet sparkle.\n"
"This would make a fine gift for a woman."
msgstr ""